1
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:07,740
You can change a pending order at any time before it trades.

2
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:11,550
Right click it and choose Modify Order.

3
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:16,040
Type a new entry rate.

4
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:20,020
You can change the amount here too.

5
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:25,870
Click Modify to save it.

6
00:00:25,970 --> 00:00:31,670
The new rate shows in the Rate column.

7
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:36,130
To cancel it, right click and choose Remove Order.

8
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:40,490
You are asked to confirm, so a slip of the mouse cannot cancel it.

9
00:00:40,590 --> 00:00:46,300
Click OK to cancel the order.

10
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:50,310
The order is cancelled and removed from Pending.

